    "description": {
      "content": "Official Workflowy REST API for reading and writing Workflowy data programmatically. A node is the fundamental unit of content in Workflowy - each node is a single bullet point that can contain text, have child nodes, and be organized hierarchically. Targets provide quick access to specific nodes, including system targets (like \"inbox\") and user-defined shortcuts. This OpenAPI document was generated by API Evangelist from the official API reference at https://workflowy.com/api-reference/ - Workflowy does not publish its own machine-readable spec.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Workflowy",
